<import src="../../templates/state.wxml"/><view class="page"><view class="h1">工业研学·一把琴的诞生课堂</view><view class="intro">走进真实制琴现场，从听琴到做琴，把作品带回家。</view><view class="panel"><view class="h3">黄桥提琴产业概况</view><view class="muted">研学课程与真实生产场景相联系。走进制琴工坊，了解乐器文化与制造工艺。</view></view><template is="state" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><image class="cover" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="card-body"><view class="tag">{{item.code}}</view><view class="h3">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.ageNote}} · {{item.durationNote}}</view><view class="intro">{{item.description}}</view><view class="muted">单人参考价 ¥{{item.referenceSinglePrice}} / 张；适用对象待核定</view><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="open">查看套餐与预约说明</button></view></view><button bindtap="group">团体需求申请</button><view class="support-note">提交预约申请后，工作人员将联系您确认安排。</view></view>
